      <p>The files are kept in <code>.dogsbay/temp/&lt;deliverable&gt;</code> in the project. Each build replaces its deliverable's previous temporary files, and the folder is ignored by Git. After a build, select <strong>Open Temp Folder</strong> in the results to open it. To remove every kept folder, select <strong>Project &gt; Project Tools &gt; Clear Temporary Build Files</strong>.</p>
